1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,153
A sieve tube is alive, but it has lost its nucleus.

2
00:00:04,153 --> 00:00:11,523
So beside each one runs a narrow companion cell, with dense cytoplasm and a big nucleus.

3
00:00:11,523 --> 00:00:16,679
It controls the sieve tube through plasmodesmata, and loads sugar into it.

